 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "There are minor misc scratches around the vehicle most too small to see in photos. The exterior of the vehicle was dusty at time of inspection. This can hide minor imperfections. The front bumper has scratches to the underside. Need to be under the vehicle to see these. Window trim and door seals were sound. Glass was free of obvious damage and the windshield wiper/washer functioned properly. Headlights and tail lights were clear and free of obvious cracks or other damage. The vehicle is equipped with correctly sized tires, and all four tires have an adequate amount of remaining tread depth. All tires are Michelin tires."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. There is light wear to the inner door panels. There is light wear to the interior trim. There were no indications of smoke or unusual odors. The climate control and infotainment systems were observed to function properly. All essential features such as windows, locks, mirrors, and gauges operated properly during the inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "The coolant reservoir is low. Exhaust shows some surface rust, but at this time has no leaks and sounds good. The oil was at the proper level and did not appear to be dark. Inspection under the oil fill cap found no signs of excessive moisture or sludge accumulation. Hoses and belts appeared to be sound. No fluid leaks were noted from the engine's top or bottom or the transmission's bottom. Inspection underneath the vehicle found all splash guards and protective panels in place."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road test",
   "text": "No error codes were detected after connecting my computer and conducting a scan. The transmission functioned properly as designed, and the vehicle handled and braked well. I did not detect any odd noises or vibrations during the inspection."
  }
 ],
